<h2>Paths</h2>
<i>"Along the winding road of life, anything can happen."<br>
-- Unknown</i>  
<p>Here you stand upon your island, contemplating what you should do.  Your ambitions lead you on a path of glory and the overthrow of the Regent who rules the area.
<p>But are you ready for such a task?  Have you gained suffcient power to overwhelm your foes? 
<p>You realize that the only way you can more power is by defeating the Lords of the sky...after then you shall have the strengh to claim the skies for yourself!

$Menu=North - ~lRain Lord,Tell,Rain
$Menu=East  - ~rThunder Lord,Tell,Thunder
$Menu=South - ~oWind Lord,Tell,Wind
$Menu=West  - ~iStorm Lord,Tell,Storm

